    "startText": "Here is a Javelin",
    "winText": "Anthony survived the engagement and even managed to strike a few blows of his own. His opponents acknowledged his effort with the traditional military courtesy of trying to hit him again.\n\nThe instructor was satisfied. Anthony was alive. By Roman standards, it had been an excellent lesson.",
